; print renders numbers as parsed, like beancount's printer: thousands
; separators, a plus sign and an expression are not kept.
2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2020-01-01 open Assets:Stock
2020-01-01 open Equity:O

2020-01-04 * "separators"
  Assets:Cash   1,000.50 USD
  Assets:Stock  2 HOOL {1,000 USD} @ 1,100.00 USD
  Assets:Cash   -1,000.50 USD
  Equity:O

2020-01-05 * "sign and expression"
  Assets:Cash   +2 USD
  Assets:Cash   (1 + 2) USD
  Assets:Cash   9 EUR @ 1,000 USD
  Equity:O
